            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Senex supercilia alba habet. The old man has white eyebrows."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, second declension. Also a frown, and so pride: supercilium — haughtiness. English supercilious."
            }
